msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Organización"

msgid "Installing OpenJDK 17"
msgstr "Instalar OpenJDK 17"

msgid "Installing Android Studio"
msgstr "Instalar Android Studio"

msgid ""
"While the Mobile Vulkan renderer has many optimizations targeted at mobile "
"devices, we're still working out the kinks. It is highly advisable to use "
"the compatibility renderer (OpenGL) for the time being when targeting "
"Android based XR devices."
msgstr ""
"Si bien el renderizador Mobile Vulkan cuenta con numerosas optimizaciones "
"para dispositivos móviles, aún estamos perfeccionando los detalles. Por el "
"momento, se recomienda usar el renderizador Compatibility (OpenGL) para "
"dispositivos XR basados en Android."

msgid ""
"The vendors plugin can be downloaded from the asset library, search for "
"\"OpenXR vendors\" and install the one named \"Godot OpenXR Vendors plugin "
"v4\"."
msgstr ""
"Los plugins de fabricantes se pueden descargar de la Librería de Assets, "
"busca OpenXR e instala el plugin llamado \"Godot OpenXR Vendors plugin v4\"."
